{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S11-1\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B1.1\", \"B2.1\", \"B2.2\", \"B2.3\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"他急着挣脱停滞，却还没能顺畅起步：试探的步子被低音波涛、重击般的和弦和爆发后重新形成的压力包围，前进首先呈现为绝境中一次次顶住压力的挣扎。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S11-1\", \"S11-2\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B1.3\", \"B1.4\", \"B3.1\", \"B3.2\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"前面柔软、私密、近乎祈祷的声音被带回可以迈步的节奏，祈祷开始成为意志；但他并未突然无所畏惧，失落也没有解决，只是停滞松开了一点，他开始愿意带着迟疑继续向前。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S11-2\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B1.2\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"到了最后四小节，步伐一点点聚拢，前进感越来越不可回避：此前仍受压力牵制的努力，终于显出持续向前的劲头。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"explains\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"beads\": [\"B2\"],\n      \"why\": \"与失落相处的难题持续施加压力，使音乐呈现为低音涌动、和弦重击、爆发后压力再生的困兽式挣扎，而不是顺境中的凯歌。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"beads\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"],\n      \"why\": \"带着迟疑继续生活的意愿，使试探的步伐逐渐转为明确的前进，让祈祷转化为意志；恐惧和紧张仍然存在，却不再完全阻止行动，停滞因此开始松动。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": []\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4dbded68-2aa6-47cf-8d5e-1cdcd2c5bd2c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T114218961491Z", "elapsed_seconds": 111.735, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T11:44:10.692076+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d7c93768e8cb93b22ffe2fc644e9ce2e3b2890b4cd58871bec4cc6ca6c8e1ffe", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-code